## About

{{ description }}

This Go project was scaffolded with `a2a init --language go`. It declares the
agent contract in native Go code, compiles that declaration to
`.a2a/agent.dsl.json`, and serves the small localhost worker endpoint that the
common A2A sidecar invokes.

## Local Setup

```bash
go run . compile
go run . worker
```

`go run . compile` writes `.a2a/agent.dsl.json`. The deployed container builds
the worker binary at `./worker` beside `a2a sidecar`; the public A2A/MCP
endpoints are served by the sidecar.

## Deploy

```bash
a2a deploy
```
